# Files graphify should not build a knowledge graph from.
#
# The vendored frontend bundle is generated output. It is committed on purpose —
# `throughline serve` serves it without needing npm — but it is minified, so its
# "entities" are identifiers like `tc`, `bm` and `cR`. In a graph built on the
# 2026-08-10 corpus it produced 474 of 3,394 nodes (13%), was the single largest
# source file, and accounted for every one of the 474 collapsed edges. Four of
# the fourteen largest communities were pure bundle noise.
#
# The React/TypeScript source it is built from lives in web/src/ and IS indexed,
# so excluding this loses no information — it removes a minified duplicate.
throughline/web/assets/

# Vite's incremental build stamp: churns on every build, carries no structure.
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
